Functions and Responsibilities of the Council. The Council shall undertake
the following:
Formulate implementing guidelines that may be necessary in ensuring the successful
implementation of the Program;

Strengthen existing youth-oriented entrepreneurship
projects and/or develop new projects
as may be necessary, for possible integration/emollment into the Program;
Undertake proper coordination with government agencies and the private sector to
facilitate provision of technical and funding assistance to Program beneficiaries;
Provide regular update reports to the President on the implementation of the Program;
Perform such other functions as may be assigned by the President.
